# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/firm_overrides.csv  - a hand-made input, not an output. Every merge and
#   keep-separate decision in it was checked by hand and cannot be regenerated.
#
# data/snapshots/MANIFEST.csv - generated, but tracked with the archive it
#   describes. Without it a fresh clone holds snapshots whose provenance and
#   hashes are unrecorded, which is the one thing the manifest exists to stop.
#
# figures/                 - a deliverable the reader sees, not an intermediate.
#
# data/snapshots/          - the archive is the asset. Oregon rotates old
#   quarters off its site (8 of 52 probed URLs were still live), so a dated
#   snapshot that is lost cannot be re-fetched, and two or more snapshots are
#   what make cash-flow reconstruction and PME possible at all.
